  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"Epic Fight 横幅\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNbAJwj8RHg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fepic-fight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/modrinth.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h2>Epic Fight</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Epic Fight 为你的玩法增添了复杂的游戏机制与战斗风格。融入一丝魂系战斗元素，以及打破《我的世界》限制的独创动画处理系统，《Epic Fight》将把游戏体验提升至全新高度，并在旅途中带来诸多精彩的新挑战。</em></p>\n<p><strong>新机制：</strong>你将面对一种全新的《我的世界》战斗方式，所有实体都拥有新颖且充满挑战的战斗机制。《Epic Fight》彻底重构了游戏，将源自 FromSoftware 旗下知名作品（如《黑暗之魂》系列、《只狼》及《艾尔登法环》）的魂系战斗体验带入其中。</p>\n<p><strong>难度：</strong>《Epic Fight》初看可能令人望而生畏，尤其是对于从未体验过魂系战斗挑战的玩家而言。然而，本作旨在面向所有玩家。我们确保了丰富的武器和技能可供获取，让每位玩家都能找到适合自己的游玩风格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h2>✨ 特色功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>魂系战斗</strong> - 探索一个拥有全新实体行为、挑战和可制作物品的大世界！</li>\n<li><strong>技能</strong> - 发现、学习并精通酷炫的新能力，解锁对抗敌人的全新方式！</li>\n<li><strong>新武器</strong> - 制作酷炫的新武器，搭配不同的技能与游玩风格！</li>\n<li><strong>灵活配置</strong> - 《Epic Fight》提供了极为丰富的配置选项，尝试所有不同的设置来打造符合你喜好的体验！</li>\n<li><strong>好友联机</strong> - 独自享受模组或与好友一同游玩，组建讨伐队伍并肩冒险！</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h2>📷 截图</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/ZZZZZZZZZ1.png\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/1827189298.png\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/207981072389172389.png\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h2>📥 安装</h2>\n<p><strong>客户端与服务器均需安装！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h2>⚙️ 配置</h2>\n<p>大多数选项可在游戏内更改，无需重启。打开 <strong>Mods → Epic Fight → Config</strong>，或直接编辑位于 <code>.minecraft/config/epicfight-common.toml</code> 的配置文件。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong>对配置文件进行的修改将在下次加载世界时生效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<h2>❤️ 致谢</h2>\n<p>由 <strong>Antikythera Studios</strong> 精心制作。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>代码与美术</strong> - Antikythera Studios 团队</li>\n<li><strong>翻译</strong> - blade_master_x, nameed, smokingbastard, luke_nogami, xablauler, a_k1m0, requiem4, shape.nan, ig114514, andy852546, kevinl2000, icewolf8964, yesman_0, kilotheneko, banikula, majmun.boy 及其他众多合作者。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>喜欢这个模组吗？在代码仓库点一颗 ⭐ 或在 Modrinth / CurseForge 上推荐该模组，将对项目发展大有裨益。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2724\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/support.png\" alt=\"支持与联盟\"></a></p>",
